<title>UK: Denmark sets 100 million stg four-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 100 million stg four-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    04.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE DEC.2000 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
